# Tapping Guide opens the Guide overlay; the D-pad steps through it and B closes it.
model dualsense
tap guide 60
advance 400
tap dpad-down 40
tap dpad-down 40
tap dpad-up 40
tap east 40
advance 200
---
shifts mode Guide layers -                                  @0
sound guide Open rise                                       @60
overlay menu "Guide" selected "Quick Settings"              @60
overlay menu "Guide" selected "Quick Settings" + info 1     @100
sound guide Step pulse                                      @460
overlay menu "Guide" selected "Edit Controls" + info 1      @460
sound guide Step pulse                                      @500
overlay menu "Guide" selected "On-screen keyboard" + info 1 @500
sound guide Step pulse                                      @540
overlay menu "Guide" selected "Edit Controls" + info 1      @540
shifts mode - layers -                                      @580
sound guide Close fall                                      @580
overlay none                                                @580
